.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt DATE 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm date
.Nd print seconds since boot
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl -selftest
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Protocol version 1 has no wall clock.  With no operands,
.Nm
reads
.Dv CLOCK_MONOTONIC
with
.Xr clock_get 2
and prints
.Dq up <seconds>s .
.Pp
.Fl -selftest
checks the clock and prints
.Dq date: selftest ok .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr clock_get 2
.Sh STANDARDS
The output is a RavenBSD interim format, not the POSIX
.Nm
date format; a wall clock is deferred to a later protocol version.
